# PURPOSE: Keep local secrets, virtual environments, caches, tests, and repository metadata out of Docker build contexts.
# RESPONSIBILITY: Limits the build context to files required by the Dockerfile; it does not replace Dockerfile allowlisted COPY instructions.
# DEPENDENCIES: Docker build context rules and the P01 repository layout.
# USED BY: docker build and Docker Compose app builds.
# TESTED BY: P01 Docker build and secret-boundary checks.

.git/
.venv/
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
tests/
docs/
README.md
